.png", "id": "2392553264515420", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823901_2392553267848753_4145866477164997808_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sCD42BwAeyEQ7kNvwF-5Z_f&_nc_oc=AdqlJusUYwnuiSVBBW81Ko-5Pa0nZOCvPBSxbd_AomM3QyI_l8bTMJUcN5C45D3-M4k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR79zLjP4dfL403yhahq3S_rUjG6nlYNpHe9Td-qt0qAA&oe=6B04640E"}, {"file_name": "27.png", "id": "849060007791741", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820387_849060011125074_4069190445085777822_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9tXA31VoyqAQ7kNvwH-M-9q&_nc_oc=AdpAFs0WmKjEg1mW7W9f0z1zJKv2pXVXi3YdUNeAL3FtDIa9u8d3WdCZy2wh3WNkF2o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQYOuFXAT2NOVPArfVoyedgvOK_x4zNIrGLs95lTA_PXA&oe=6B04872C"}, {"file_name": "32.png", "id": "841714191676625", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300619_841714195009958_216825495650438070_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=775D8Sc55KIQ7kNvwF5njlC&_nc_oc=AdqTlP3O7eh4ewO937MgLs0vo_lxXwWg8k6ClIUWheZmn2vfEq_dzAELgHBBBnoURR4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT1_uE_0fr9ahoI_cFy2kEN1ifyouDoFwG4eZSD22AoaQ&oe=6B0470EC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Landscape (2).png", "id": "1487203116629993", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604317775_1487203119963326_937934348911748853_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aWUR51C0uE8Q7kNvwHQfnK9&_nc_oc=Ado0_-5ng5psnrtGVdYlflYB8CaOhdau4yFVod6SqW_WupNzHwaTKg2NtSwQAvnyB3w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS93weTIvp8PA0upXHmzbM0iwaBbN_qmZe0IboqUXwzzw&oe=6B047589"}, "display_name": "EGG VR T\u0130TAN", "keywords": ["scary", "baboon", "dino", "hero", "fun"], "long_description": "**Run, climb, and jump in VR using a unique Baboon Movement inspired by Gorilla Tag.**\n\n# \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Mini-Games \n\n**You can play different mini-games such as:**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc40 Squid Game**\n\n- **\ud83e\udd88 Steal a Monkey**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc7b Fun Horror Games**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc12 Hatch Egg**\n\n\n#  Steal a Brainrot\n\n**Steal Dino Brainrots and raise them and get rich**\n\n{2842365595962805}\n____________________________________________________________________.\n# \ud83d\udc7b Horror Mode\n\n**Run away from the Baboon Monster,  and fight against the boss**\n\n{851464257334354}\n\n____________________________________________________________________.\n#  \ud83e\udda0 Smash Mode\n\n**Tag Everyone and swing like a Gorilla or Baboon**\n\n{1317578033136114}\n____________________________________________________________________.\n#  \ud83e\udda0 Giant Mode\n{1554376978890768}\n____________________________________________________________________.\n# \ud83d\udd2b Shooter Mode\n\n**Play the best Rivals Shooter game**\n\n{25044154225189929}\n____________________________________________________________________.\n# \ud83d\udd2b NEW BOMBS and Mini Games\n\n**Get eggs and hatch them. Name and ride your chicken, snail, or your dino.**\n\n{4134103796903773}\n\n{1852341419024466}\n____________________________________________________________________.\n\nAnd try to survive in the new Forest in 99 nights, Egg VR 99 Nights Survive from Deer is Coming.\n\n# \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Mini-Games \n\n**You can play different mini-games such as:**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc40 Squid Game**\n\n- **\ud83e\udd88 Steal a Monkey**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc7b Fun Monkey Horror Games**\n\n- **\ud83d\udc12 Egg Smash**\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf1f Become an Egg!\n\n", "short_description": "Become an Egg VR Halloween, play all the popular Minigames."}]}, "developer_name": "FutureOfVR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://futureofvr.games/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Futur